Serialized FileDescriptorProtos for tests/t_proto_extract.sh, and the .proto
source proto-extract writes for them (without its two header lines).
- orders.desc: a proto3 file built with Python's protobuf package (map, oneof,
  proto3 optional, nested types, negative enum value, reserved ranges, a
  service with a streaming method, an import, file options).
- descriptor.desc: google/protobuf/descriptor.proto as the protobuf package
  ships it (proto2: defaults, extension ranges, nested enums).
